    <string name="roadcrew_live_truck_map_background_active">Background collection is active, with or without a route.</string>
    <string name="roadcrew_live_truck_map_optional">Optional for setup and standard navigation. Community-validated truck routing is available only while anonymous segment sharing is enabled.</string>
    <string name="roadcrew_live_truck_map_consent">Record truck passages, including in background, and share confirmed sections</string>
    <string name="roadcrew_live_truck_map_wizard_body">Optional: help build the truck map. After you open RoadCrew with the Truck profile and location permission, recording continues while you use other apps, with or without a route. Removing RoadCrew from Recent apps stops independent background recording; active truck navigation continues until the route is stopped. Android displays a recording notification. Review saved journeys and exclude any car sections before sharing. Only segment keys, 15-minute time buckets and aggregate match quality are uploaded, not a raw GPS trail, exact passage times, names or registration plates.</string>
    <string name="roadcrew_live_truck_map_profile_body">With sharing enabled and the Truck profile, recording works in RoadCrew and in the background, with or without navigation. Removing RoadCrew from Recent apps stops independent background recording; active truck navigation continues until the route is stopped. Stopping navigation while RoadCrew remains open does not stop collection. Only confirmed truck sections enter the community score. Disabling sharing removes community-layer access, stops collection and deletes pending local data; standard navigation and safety warnings remain available.</string>
